        "text_zzkpVm": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At Mercy Health Aged Care, the commitment to safety and the welfare of their residents has always been a top priority. In their journey to enhance safety measures and efficiency, Mercy Health Aged Care made a strategic decision to have their maintenance officers handle testing and tagging internally. This move significantly reduced their dependence on external contractors, saving costs while equipping their staff with essential skills.<br/><br/>Since 2016, <strong>they've purchased 50 PAT testers, trained 50 staff, conducted 38 tester calibrations, and applied 7000 New to Service tags</strong>, ensuring the highest safety standards for their residents and employees. Their success story is a testament to the power of internal testing and tagging in aged care facilities.</p>",
